Hi,
I have same problem and following problem and found that as workaround can modify these two lines to fix
```javascript
    const example = exports.example ? `example: () => import("${to_posix(
      join("http://localhost:7861/@fs/"+component.frontend_dir, exports.example)
    )}"),
` : "";
    return `${acc}"${component.component_class_id}": {
			${example}
			component: () => import("${to_posix(
      join("http://localhost:7861/@fs/"+component.frontend_dir, exports.component)
    )}")
			},
`;
  }, "");
``` 
url "http://localhost:7861/@fs/" is added to frontend_dir
the file modified is in path frontend\node_modules\@participant12\preview\dist\index.js
